¯The country's leading expert on organic food delivers the ultimate guide to the new culinary health movement--feasting on fermented probiotics, from artisanal cheese to kimchi.
In his extensive career as a bestselling cookbook author and TV garden-show host, Jeff Cox has always been keenly aware of the microbiology that helps his garden flourish. He has long known that microbes keep our bodies healthy as they ferment food, releasing their nutritional power and creating essential vitamins and enzymes. In The Essential Book of Fermentation, Cox shares a bounty of recipes for nourishing the internal "garden."
Simplifying the art and science of fermentation, Cox offers a primer on the body's microbial ecosystem, complemented by scrumptious recipes, and easy-to-follow pickling and canning techniques. Basics such as bread and yogurt help readers progress to wine, cheese, and a host of international delicacies, including kim chi and chow chow. Inspiring and innovative, The Essential Book of Fermentationserves up great taste along with great health on every page."³
°E istoria xekina m' ena telephonema pou dekhetai o eroas tou bibliou apo te Phentora, ton neaniko tou erota: ekeine ekhei molis bgei apo tis italikes phulakes, meta ten ektise tes poines tes gia summetokhe sten tromokratike organose Prima Linea.
Kai meta arkhizoun oi mnemes: Paidia, ezesan se ena eleutheriako koinobio* epeita perasan sto mathetiko kai phoitetiko kinema kai entakhthekan se aristeristikes organoseis, prota ste Gallia ki ustera sten Italia. Summeteikhan se lesteies kai enoples epitheseis. Ekeine sunekhise. Autos stamatese, ligo prin patesei te skandale.
O Stephan Osmon apotuponei ton apisteuto dunamismo mias exegermenes genias, me tis outopikes prosdokies tes, tis gennaiodores kai anarkhes autapates tes, ton pneumatiko tes anabrasmo, te mousike tes eurematikoteta, ta narkotika, ta biblia kai ta periodika tes, tous eleutherous erotes tes...
"Ena entuposiako mosaiko, opou mia pathiasmene erotike istoria sunuphainetai me te leptomere politike anaparastase. O Osmon upographei to kalutero tou biblio"
(Le Nouvel Observateur)
"O Osmon upographei to pio prosopiko kai bathu biblio tou* to pio truphero kai ameilikto, epises. Teinei ton kathrephte se mia genia pou, pera apo ton mutho tes, metraei ta khamena paidia tes"
(Le Monde)
"E epopoiia enos aristeriste mathete sten elektrismene atmosphaira ton sebentis. Mia epokhe pou pote den epapse na sageneuei."
(Chronic'art)
"Ena megalo, sunarpastiko muthistorema, pou anakalei ste mneme mas mia epokhe opou mporouse kaneis akoma na oneireutei, na kanei lathe, na paraplanethei me gennaiodoria."
(La Libre Belgique)"µ

²
Sto komikotragiko aristourgema tou Mpokhoumil Khrampal to apisteuto ginetai pragmatikoteta me tous pleon paradoxous tropous. Sto Uperetesa ton Agglo basilia o koruphaios Tsekhos suggrapheas perigraphei sourealistikes katastaseis me diathese satirike kai aphoplistike phusikoteta. Protagonistes tes istorias einai enas tapeinos anthropakos, o Gian Ntitie, o opoios mporei na einai kontoules alla ekhei exairetika upseles philodoxies. Einai ena asemanto gkarsoni pou douleuei s' ena polutelestato xenodokheio tes Pragas, ligo prin xespasei o B Pagkosmios Polemos. O megalos stokhos tes zoes tou einai na ginei ekatommurioukhos, na kataxiothei epaggelmatika, na brei mia omorphe gunaika kai na kerdisei ton sebasmo oson ton upotimousan. Kapoia stigme kaleitai na uperetesei okhi ton Agglo basilia alla ton autokratora tes Aithiopias, gegonos pou theorei monadiko sten kariera tou. Ste sunekheia eroteuetai mia athletria ton nazi, ten epokhe pou oi Germanoi eisballoun sten Tsekhoslobakia. Meta to telos tou polemou, ekmetalleuomenos kati spania grammatosema pou anekan stous Ebraious, aggizei to oneiro tou kai kataphernei na stesei to diko tou xenodokheio, to <>. Argotera omos egkathidruetai to komounistiko kathestos, o Gian khanei ta panta kai katalegei sto dasos, monos alla eleutheros.
<>.
MILAN KOUNTERA
<>.
The New York Times"¿	
¼	Kaneis apo te genia mas den prolabe.
Mas prolabainan alla.
Polemos, Dekembres, emphulios, diktatoria.
Olo ta palia thumomaste. Mas bariountai.
Den leme na ta xekhasoume, einai ole mas e zoe.
Poses phores eipame na te phtiaxoume apo ten arkhe!
Den einai to kouragio pou mas eleipse...
E Arraboniastikia tou Akhillea einai ena megalopneusto biblio, pou apotelei tome ste neotere pezographia mas... Einai megalopneusto, giati apo ton kairo tou Tsirka kai ton Akuberneton Politeion kanenas allos Ellenas suggrapheas den epikheirese n'agkaliasei me to blemma tou ten poreia tou neoterou ellenismou okhi mono mesa sten istoria, alla kai mesa sto geographiko khoro...
Demosthenes Kourtobik, Skholiastes
Aute e Arraboniastikia tou Akhillea einai enas "apokhairetismos sta opla", sto oneiro kai t'orama enos oloklerou kosmou, ena Rekbiem gia te Genia tes Nikephoras Epanastases pou khatheke.
Kostas Stamatiou, Ta Nea
To gegonos pou kanei to biblio tes Alkes Zee na men einai aplos mia akome katathese einai o tropos me ton opoio sumplekontai to bioma, o muthos kai e istoria e kalutera e tekhne me ten opoia e istoria metallazei se muthistorema kai to muthistorematiko uliko istorikopoieitai.
Maria Stasinopoulou, To Bema"É
Æ1942. Katekhomene Tsekhoslobakia.
Duo Tsekhoslobakoi partizanoi stalmenoi apo to Londino pephtoun me alexiptoto konta sten Praga. Apostole tous na dolophonesoun ton pio epikinduno antra tou G' Raikh: ton Rainkharnt Khaintrikh, <>, ton <>, ton arkhego ton germanikon mustikon uperesion, to dexi kheri tou Khainrikh Khimler. Prokeitai gia ten Epikheirese Anthropoeides, mia apo tis pio tolmeres kai eroikes apopeires tou B' Pagkosmiou polemou.
Perigraphontas me kathelotiko tropo ten apopeira dolophonias tou Khaintrikh, to HHhH sunthetei mia panoramike eikona tou G' Raikh kai tes periodou tou B' Pagkosmiou polemou. Mia sunarpastike istoria aprosmetretou eroismou kai suntrophikotetas, prodosias kai ekdikeses."Ô
ÑO Arithmos 11 einai ena muthistorema gia te mustike skhese anamesa ston esoteriko mas kosmo kai ton kosmo pou mas periballei, kai gia to pos mas epereazei aute e skhese.
Gia o,ti aphese piso tou o polemos kai gia to telos tes athootetas.
Gia to pos kontarokhtupiountai e komodia me ten politike, alla kai gia to pos e komodia, mallon,kerdizei.
Gia te zoe se mia pole opou oi trapezites khreiazontai kinematographous sta upogeia tous eno, sto diplano steno, uparkhoun alloi anthropoi pou ekhoun anagke apo trapezes trophimon gia na epibiosoun.
O Arithmos 11 sundeetai me to muthistorema tou Tzonathan Koou Ti oraio pliatsiko!
O Koou xanapianei to nema gia na milesei gia ten epokhe mas, aggizontas ptukhes tes kathemerines zoes pou oloi antimetopizoume, phobomaste kai apolambanoume.
