O Koou einai enas apo tous elakhistous muthistoriographous pou ekhoun na poun kati ousiastiko gia to pneuma ton kairon mas. [...] Oi ametretes aretes tou Koou kathistoun to ergo tou aprosbleto apo ton khrono. Kanenasallos sugkhronos muthistoriographos denmporei na skiagraphesei kalutera tenabebaioteta tes zoes tes mesaias taxes.
Observer
O Koou einai exairetikos sten epinoese peritekhnon istorion me plokes pou diastauronontai, gematon apo uporretes anaphores sten kuriarkhe koultoura, apo asteies skenes parexegeseon pou odegoun se katastrophikes paranoeseis... Me khara diapistono oti sto neo tou muthistorema o Koou epistrephei se o,ti xerei na kanei kalutera.
The Sunday Times
Den mporeis na to apheseis apo ta kheria sou... me stoikheione gia meres.
The Independent
E proza tou Koou einai panta mia apolause... mia exairetike eukharistese.
The Daily Mail
Gemato komikes skenes... Apisteuta apolaustiko, prokletika diaskedastiko.
The Financial Times"Ù
ÖO basikos axonas guro apo ton opoio peristrephetai to paron biblio einai e metatrope mias mikres eparkhias tes Othomanikes Autokratorias se ena sugkhrono europaiko kratos. Apo orismenes apopseis, ta problemata pou anekupsan kata ton skhematismo tou sugkhronou ellenikou kratous tha mporousan na exomoiothoun me ta antistoikha problemata pou sunantoun aute te stigme oi prospatheies tou dutikou kosmou na epibalei to diko tou politiko kai politismiko montelo se koinonies xenes, an okhi ekhthrikes pros auto. To gegonos oti oi Ellenes tou 19ou kai 20ou aiona einai khristianoi, eno oi koinonies pou apoteloun semera antikeimeno peiramatismou tes Duses einai mousoulmanikes, mikre semasia ekhei, ston bathmo pou kai oi duo antimetopistekan e antimetopizontai, reta e okhi, os pedia ekpolitismou kai se kamia periptose os isotimoi etairoi tou politikou egkheirematos sto opoio apodidetai, mallon akrita, o oros eksugkhronismos. Exallou, o khristianismos ton Ellenon den epapse pote na antiprosopeuei to Skhisma, delade mia idiaiteroteta se sugkrise me tis dutikoeuropaikes antilepseis, okhi pantote sumpathe, kai akome ligotero katanoete.
Ostoso, se aute te sugkrise uparkhei mia diaphora pou einai adunaton na agnoethei. Antikeimeno tou bibliou einai e Ellada kai oi Ellenes, kai aute e -ethnikou kharaktera pleon- kategoria, ek ton pragmaton, suneirmika anapheretai se o,ti oi Dutikoeuropaioi theoroun os themelia tou politismou tous. Apo ten apopse aute, mporei eukola na ermeneuthei e idiaitere, os enan bathmo toulakhiston, metakheirise pou epiphulaxe e Duse stous plethusmous pou den exegerthekan aplos enantion tes Othomanikes Autokratorias sto onoma tou khristianismou, alla epikalestekan, meso tou onomatos tous, te sundese me ena parelthon sto opoio e Europe blepei tis rizes tes dikes tes tautotetas. Prokeitai gia mia antilepse pou anakaleitai polu sukhna apo olous osoi theloun na uposterixoun e na polemesoun tis exezetemenes sukhna epiloges ton Ellenon, stous opoious kata ton 19o aiona oi Europaioi tha apodosoun ton kharakterismo ta "kakomathemena paidia tes Istorias". (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"Ú	
×	Sten Ispania tou 16ou aiona, enas ntelales stoToledo, o Latharigio nte Tormes, existorei s' ena gramma pos kataphere apo mikro paidi na epibiosei para te phtokhia kai tous asplakhnous aphentes tou, kai giati anekhetai na moirazetai te gunaika tou me ton arkhipresbutero tes enorias. O aphegetes einai ena paidi tou dromou pou diegeitai ta basana tou kai tis poneries pou skaronei gia na men pethanei apo ten peina. Mekhri pou telos, ekhontas parei sklera mathemata apo te zoe, mathainei to sumpheron tou kai katalegei kunikos kai upokrites san olous. O Latharigio einai panexupnos, me diabolemeno khioumor kai dieisdutike matia pou steliteuei: anthropoi ap' oles tis taxeis, e ekklesia kai oi ekprosopoi tes exousias, oloi parousiazontai me exairetike glaphuroteta pou apokaluptei ten upokrisia, te philarguria kai te mataiodoxia tes epokhes. Grammeno guro sta 1554, apo suggraphea pou thelese na parameinei anonumos, to satiriko auto keimeno einai apo ta semantikotera erga ton ispanikon grammaton, kathos diaphoropoieitai apo te mesaionike logotekhnia tes epokhes kai anoigei to dromo gia to sugkhrono muthistorema.
E metaphrase tes Ismenes Kanse timetheke me to Brabeio Logotekhnikes Metaphrases Ispanophones Logotekhnias EKEMEL (2007)."Û
ØS' auto to ekplektiko muthistorema o Karl Oube Knaousgkornt anametratai me ten idia tou te zoe me epodune eilikrineia. Graphei gia ta paidika khronia kai ten ephebeia tou, to pathos tou gia te rok mousike, te skhese tou me mia skhedon anuparkte metera pou omos agapouse, alla kai ton apomakro, aproblepto patera tou, o thanatos tou opoiou epephere okhi mono odune alla kai sugkhuse.
Apo te stigme pou o Karl Oube ginetai kai o idios gonios prepei na exisorropesei tis apaiteseis pou ekhei e phrontida mias oikogeneias me ten apophasistikoteta tou na grapsei spoudaia logotekhnia.
Me to Enas thanatos sten oikogeneia, to proto meros mias exatomes logotekhnikes autobiographias pou ekhei prokalesei pagkosmia aisthese, o Knaousgkornt sunethese mia pananthropine istoria gia tis sugkrouseis, me tis opoies erkhomaste antimetopoi ste zoe mas, s' auton ton agona pou einai e zoe mas.
Ena biblio apolutos sageneutiko, ikano na sumparasurei ton euaistheto anagnoste, grammeno me mia braduphlege entase, san na exartatai apo auto e idia e uparxe tou suggraphea. To proto biblio tes muthistorematikes seiras O agonas mou."Ü

Ù
E zoe enos planodiou mikropolete kai tes agapemenes tou. Mia istoria agapes ste sugkhrone Pole. Gia perissotero apo 40 khronia, apo to 1969 eos to 2012, o Meblout trigurizei sta sokakia tes Poles. Einai diaphoretikos apo tous anthropous guro tou, uparkhei kati "paraxeno" sto nou tou! Prospathei na katalabei ti einai auto pou ton xekhorizei apo tous allous, apo pou proerkhetai aute e "paraxenia". Allazei epaggelmata, brisketai konta stis allages pou zei e khora tou, stis politikes sugkrouseis, sta praxikopemata. Apo epiloge tou den stamataei pote na poulaei mpoza tis kheimoniatikes nukhtes, anarotietai panta poia pragmatika einai e agapemene tou kai pose semasia ekhei ston erota to pepromeno. Exartontai e eutukhia kai e dustukhia mas apo tis epiloges mas; E mepos orimazoun anexarteta, exo apo emas, kai meis aplos tis zoume, aplos mas sumbainoun; O eroas tou ginetai marturas tes ekrektikes metallaxes tes Istanmpoul se mia terastia pole. Kathos allazoun oi dromoi kai ta sokakia pou gnorise paidi, allazei kai o idios. To paidi kai o ephebos dinoun te these tous ston suzugo kai ton patera. Ta authaireta kai oi paragkes dinoun te these tous stis leophorous kai tis polukatoikies. E pole tou ginetai agnoriste alla o Meblout anti na apoxenonetai tes pianei ten koubenta, ki aphenei etsi na sunomilesoun e psukhe tes poles tou me tous kaemous tes kardias tou."Ş
ÛTi koino mporei na uparkhei anamesa ston ispaniko Emphulio Polemo, ten anti-kastrike mania ton E.P.A., tis mustikistikes teletes mias khamenes phules tou Amazoniou, mia oikogeneia Ispanon gaioktemonon, to strategeio tes CIA kai tous dromous tes Abanas; Giati oloi anazetoun to phullo enos dentrou pou brisketai stis pio dusprosites periokhes tes zougklas tou Amazoniou kai einai gnosto mono se kapoies phules indianon kai se elakhistous leukous; Gia na apoktethoun ta polupotheta phulla me ten ephialtike murodia kai tis magikes idiotetes, e kinetopoiese einai oloklerotike. Khiliometra pezoporias, ereunes me kano kai aeroplana, ptoseis me alexiptoto, botanologikes, glossologikes kai semeiologikes meletes kai polla egklemata prokeimenou na ekleipsoun oi enokhletikoi martures... (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)
Ta "Khairetismata sto theio" einai ena philodoxo egkheirema, mia peripeteia se diaphores periokhes tou kosmou kai tautokhrona mia katagraphe istorikon gegonoton pou diaplekontai me epeisodia gennemena apo te phantasia. Apotelei sunduasmo epistemonikes phantasias, thriler kai aphegematos kataskopeias. Protistos omos einai ena politiko muthistorema. O suggrapheas milaei gia te CIA, tis drasteriotetes tes, tis methodous tes, te philosophia tes, olo to plegma ton sumpheronton kai ton stokhon tes. Prodelos thelei na katadeixei to poso atelesphore etan kai einai mekhri stigmes e drase tes sten Kouba, kati pou phaneke okhi mono apo ten apotukhemene apobase ston Kolpo ton Khoiron to 1961 alla kai apo tis anepitukheis apopeires dolophonias tou Kastro. (PhILIPPOS PhILIPPOU, To Bema, 27/9/1998)"à	
İ	Mia eliolouste nukhta kalokairiou ston pagomeno borra, enas andras kataphthanei s' ena laponeziko khorio koubalontas mia dermatine tsanta, ena pistoli ki ena tsantaki gemato khartonomismata. To onoma tou einai Oulph. E mporei kai na men einai. Einai pleromenos dolophonos. E mporei kai na men einai. Tha sunantesei mia panemorphe gunaika pou mporei na einai e kai na men einai khera, enan ierokeruka pou mporei na pisteuei e kai na men pisteuei ston Theo, ton trelo tou khoriou pou mporei na einai e kai na men einai dianoia, enan tarando pou mporei na einai e na men einai kalos oionos.
O Oulph iskhurizetai oti ekhei erthei sto khorio gia kunegi. Omos oute e sezon einai soste, oute gia kunegos moiazei, oute toupheki koubalaei. Epeide aute te phora to thuma einai o idios. Ton kunegoun giati den ekane sosta te douleia tou sto Oslo. Giati skephtotan parapano ap' o,ti eprepe. Giati den mporouse na trabexei te skandale.
E sunekheia tou mpest seler Aima sto khioni kalei ton anagnoste na lusei ena idiotupo staurolexo: Poios einai o Oulph; Kai ti skhese ekhei me ton megalomaphiozo Psara; Giati enas pleromenos dolophonos n' adunatei na skotosei; Kai pos ginetai to ptoma enos anthropou pou dolophoneitai sto Oslo na emphanizetai ste Brazilia;"ä
áEna meseliko zeugari eroteuetai paraphora mia neare phoitetria -ten idia omos phoitetria pou enas allos, anonumos kai aphulos gia ekeinen epistolographos poliorkei sugkhronos me pathiasmena erotika semeiomata. Mes' apo ten istoria tous mporeite na koitaxete kata prosopo s' enan kathrephte. Enan kathrephte pou antanakla esas, tis epithumies sas, e anthropous san esas, me epithumies san tis dikes sas. Pano ap' ola ostoso to biblio auto einai ena mousiko ergo, pou oi tesseris organopaikhtes tou, aisthetika kai aisthesiaka, paskhizoun na anikhneusoun te daimonike sumptose pou oi anthropoi apokaloune erota."ä
áSton pharo enos mikroskopikou nesiou mise mera me karabi apo tis aktes tes dutikes Australias, ergazetai o Tom Sermpourn, pou ekhei epizesei apo te phrike tou A Pagkosmiou polemou. Sto pleuro tou ekhei te neare gunaika tou, ten Izi, me ten opoia zei ten apolute eutukhia tou erota, pou mono ena pragma phainetai na skiazei, e suneidetopoiese oti de tha mporesoun na kanoun telika paidia...
Ospou ena apriliatiko proino sten paralia exokellei mia barka. Mesa ste barka aute uparkhei to apsukho soma enos antra ki ena moro pou klaiei goera... Ksekommenoi apo ton exo kosmo, o Tom kai e Izi th' apsephesoun tous kanones tes logikes kai tous nomous ton anthropon kai tha akolouthesoun ten kardia tous...
