çRixame kai oi duo mia matia sto roloi. O khronos mas eikhe teleiosei edo kai merika lepta. Arga arga o Tsarls mazepse ta pragmata tou. <>psithurise. <>. Sekotheka stetos, isiosa tous omous. <>. Tou anoixa ten porta tou grapheiou kai opos kathe phora dosame ta kheria kathos epheuge. Ekleisa ten porta kai xaphnika khtupesa me ten palame mou to metopo mou kai eipa: <>. Ksananoixa ten porta, ton phonaxa kai tou eipa: <>. Ton koitaxa kai perimena. Den exera pos th' antidrouse. <>. <>. --"ë
èKseroume semera kalutera tis diergasies genneses autou tou ergou zoes, autou tou aperantou potamou lexeon pou sugklonise te logotekhnia tou 20ou aiona, ste Gallia alla kai s' olo ton kosmo. O anagnostes erkhetai edo s' epaphe sunama me mia epopoiia tes skepses, m' ena taxidi stous laburinthous tou kosmikou, kallitekhnikou kai dianoetikou stereomatos tes epokhes tou Proust, me mian axiothaumaste psukhologike melete, ki ola auta sten uperesia mias anepanaleptes glossas. Kseroume epises tis peristaseis tou thanatou tou Marsel Proust, ten eggraphe tes lexes "telos" kai ten upagoreuse ton teleutaion phraseon, ten exantlese tou suggraphea apo toute ten anazetese kai anakalupse tou khamenou khronou. Kseroume isos ligotero tis peristaseis pou odegesan sten emphanise tes ellenikes metaphrases tou ergou: ekhoume na kanoume edo me tis duskolies, ten oxuderkeia kai te duname enos anthropou, mesa apo tis opoies gennetheke kai prospheretai semera stous anagnostes to "Anazetontas ton khameno khrono"."î
ëO epitheoretes Patrik epistrephei ste douleia ustera apo anarrotike adeia. Prospathese na xekourastei kai na phrontisei te gunaika tou me ta duo proora diduma mora tous.
Den prolabainei na patesei to podi tou sto astunomiko tmema kai mia nea ereuna xekina. Enas antras brisketai dolophonemenos sto diamerisma tou. Ton ekhoun purobolesei ste base tou kephaliou tou.
To thuma einai o Mats Sberin, o diakheiristes ton oikonomikon tou demotikou sumbouliou, enas philikos kai sumpathes tupos. Kaneis den ekhei na tou prosapsei kati.
O Patrik tha khartographesei te zoe tou pou ekrube mustika pera apo kathe upopsia. Giati biazotan toso na phugei apo to Getemporg kai na epistrepsei ste Phielmpaka; Ti rolo epaixe ste metatrope tou paliou loutrou tes Phielmpaka se spa; Einai sumptose pou e agapemene tou apo ten paidike tou elikia, e Anni, ekhei epises epistrepsei ste Phielmpaka;"ñ

