Enas ekatontakhronos sta khnaria tou Phorest Gkamp -ean o Gkamp etan eidikos sta ekrektika kai timouse uper tou deontos te botka- apophasizei oti pote den einai arga gia na kaneis mia kainourgia arkhe...
Mesa sten esukhia tes kamaras tou, sto gerokomeio, o Alan Karlson perimenei ena parti pou eukhetai na men arkhize pote. Prokeitai gia to parti ton ekatoston genethlion tou. O demarkhos kai oi demotikoi sumbouloi tha einai parontes. Oi demosiographoi apo ta topika mesa enemeroses tha einai epises parontes. O Alan, omos, apophasizei na einai apon.
Etsi, bazei tis pantophles tou kai to skaei apo to parathuro. Ekhontas kanei te megale exodo, tha zesei mian apithane peripeteia e opoia tha ton pherei antimetopo me diaphorous egklematies, mia balitsa gemate metreta, kamposous anikanous astunomikous kai enan elephanta. Gia opoiondepote allo, aute e peripeteia tha etan monadike. Okhi omos gia ton Alan pou ekhei ena sugklonistiko parelthon, aphou ekhei moirastei geumata -kai polla perissotera- me ton Stalin, ton Tsortsil, ton Mao, ton Phranko, ton Trouman kai ton nte Gkol, ekhontas diadramatisei ena rolo-kleidi se merikes apo tis koruphaies stigmes tou 20ou aiona.
Ena xekardistika asteio kai bathutata anthropino muthistorema gia to tapeino megaleio tes kathe meras kai ten omorphia tou na zeis me pathos akoma kai otan o kosmos paei na se peisei oti ola einai apelpistika askhema."ø

