O Tsoukourou, enas triantaexakhronos skhediastes siderodromikon stathmon, pou to onoma tou semainei "phtiakhno" e "khtizo" -okhi omos "demiourgo"-, pisteuei pos diagei bio akhromo, khoris ikhnos prosopikotetas. Sta eikosi tou aporriptetai, gia agnostous logous kai me sunoptikes diadikasies, apo ten exidanikeumene parea tou: duo agoria kai duo koritsia, me onomata pou parapempoun antistoikha se tessera diaphoretika khromata. O "akhromos" Tsoukourou apodekhetai ten aporripse siopera, phtanei logo tou sunaisthematikou sok sta prothura tou thanatou kai telika epanerkhetai sten kanonike zoe tou khoris na ekhei ousiastika sunelthei. Ospou epeita apo dekaexi khronia, e Sara, mia gunaika pou ton endiapherei sobara, diablepei to sunaisthematiko tou mplokarisma, thetei to dakhtulo epi ton tupon ton elon kai ton othei sto autonoeto: na epidioxei, esto kai ek ton usteron, mia ek batheon epaphe me ten "polukhrome" parea tou gia na photisei tis leptomereies tou bathia krummenou psukhikou traumatos tou, na katanoesei ta aitia kai na kheiristei ten pragmatikoteta me tropo lutrotiko gia ton idio kai gia te metaxu tous skhese.
O koruphaios Kharouki Mourakami apotuponei me maestria sto kharti ten axiomnemoneute istoria enos nearou antra pou ton stoikheionei mia terastia apoleia. Mia istoria gia oneira kai ephialtes, gia ta taxidia sto parelthon pou einai aparaiteta gia na therapeutei to paron."ù
öTo muthistorema <>tou Canek Sanchez Guevara einai mia eilikrines istoria gia tis apogoeteuseis mias genias pou pistepse stis idees tes epanastases tou Kastro, alla kai mia dieisdutike matia ste zoe ton aplon anthropon sten Kouba kata te diarkeia ton teleutaion dekaetion.
O kentrikos eroas khorizei ap' te gunaika tou kai pernaei ton perissotero khrono tou parea me mia rosida geitonissa tou, khare sten opoia anakaluptei ten apolause tes anagnoses. Ta biblia pou diabazei anoigoun stadiaka tous orizontes tou, eno ton periballei e gkriza kai diabrotike pragmatikoteta: e routina tou grapheiou, ta kathemerina mikra e megala parapona apo sunadelphous, oi dikes tou emmonikes skepseis.
Kathe mera ginetai marturas tou thliberou theamatos ton neon anthropon pou egkataleipoun to nesi me autoskhedia mesa, kai ta bradia basanizetai apo kaphkikous ephialtes stous opoious sullambanetai kai dikazetai khoris aitia. Ta pragmatika tou problemata omos tha xekinesoun otan tha klethei na ginei plerophoriodotes tou kratous."ÿ	
ü	E Agknes, neare istorikos, graphei te diplomatike tes me antikeimeno ten anodo ton akrodexion reumaton sten Islandia kai ten Europe. Gia tis anagkes tes ereunas tes, sunanta ton Arnor, enan neonazi dianooumeno, kai ton eroteuetai, para te lithouanoebraike tes katagoge. O suntrophos tes, o Omar bazei photia sto spiti tous, otan diapistonei ten apistia tes Agknes.
Tha mporouse na einai ena sunethismeno erotiko trigono, kapos prokletiko isos (Ebraia sunaptei erotike skhese me nazi).
To Illska (To Kako ) einai, omos, kati polu perissotero. Kanei mia boutia sten istorike mneme, sten kataktese tes Lithouanias apo tous Germanous kai te mazike exontose ton Ebraion tes khoras, pou diexagetai me ten energo sunergasia meridas tou ntopiou plethusmou (anamesa tous kai oi khristianoi progonoi tes Agknes, apo ten pleura tou patera tes, pou skotosan tous Ebraious, apo ten pleura tes meteras tes, progonous tes), gia na perasei sto epikinduno semera. Kurio thema autes tes aristotekhnikes, iliggiodous, poluphonikes kai poluprismatikes aphegeses einai to Olokautoma kai to epimono erotema pou thetei: Pos mporese na sumbei auto to apoluto kako; Pos den tha epanalephthei; Pos o sugkhronos phasismos, o opoios stadiaka metatrepetai se <>phainomeno, einai dunaton na antimetopistei;"
şO nearos giatros Alkes, kato apo ten piese tes theias tou, anagkazetai na khorisei ten kopela pou agapa, kai stelnetai "exoria" se ena bouno gia na parakolouthei ten ugeia mias phumatikes kopelas, pou perna ta kalokairia tes ekei, mazi me ton patera tes.
Sten diarkeia tes diamones tou, tha gnorisei kai tha agapesei ena agno koritsi tes phuses, panemorpho kai athoo, idio.. agriolouloudo. Otan omos apophasizei na pherei to koritsi sten Athena, diapistonei poso lathos ekane pou ten xerizose apo ton topo tes."␀␀`@"	
